I walk through the streets of Berlin.
It is very cold today.
The wind is blowing hard.
My face is completely cold.
I want to warm up.
So I look for a cozy place.
I walk for a few more minutes.
Then I see a nice, small café.
It is located right on a corner.
Through the large window I see warm light.
That looks very cozy.
I really need a coffee now.
I walk quickly to the café.
I stand in front of the door.
I am looking forward to the warmth.
Then I go inside.
